!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Total RNA was extracted from fresh frozen ovarian cancer tissue using TRIsure reagent (Bioline) according to the manufacturer’s protocol and then treated with DNase I (TAKARA) for 1h. DNase I-treated RNA was cleaned using NucleoSpin RNA Clean‑up, Mini kit (MACHEREY-NAGEL). RNA concentration and quality were evaluated using a NanoDrop 3000 spectrophotometer (Thermo Fisher Scientific) and a TAPESTATION (Agilent), respectively.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = All cDNA libraries were prepared using the Illumina TruSeq Stranded Total RNA and the Ribo- Zero Gold LT Sample Prep Kit according to manufacturer's  instructions.
!Sample_data_processing = Libraries were sequenced for 65 cycles on an Illumina HiSeq 2500 according to the manufacturer’s instructions.
!Sample_data_processing = BAM-formatted map files were generated using STAR version 2.6.1d with default parameters.
